        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana SDP60, Contemporary Pocket Door Passage Set</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis pocket pull is for use on sliding pocket doors. A passage set, it is for doors that do not need to be locked such as those found leading into hallways and closets. Standard duty for use on 1-3/8\" thick pocket doors. The large contemporary pocket door pull set will fit a common standard 2-1/4\" x 1-3/4\" door cutout. It has a built in flip out edge pull, to get the sliding door out of its pocket. Easy to install, it comes packaged with all mounting hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/deltana-SDP60_size.gif?v=1704354522\" width=\"600\" height=\"350\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana SDP60 Contemporary Pocket Door Passage Set Size\">\r\n</p> \r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: Matching <a href=\"/products/large-contemporary-pocket-door-privacy-lock-deltana-sdl60\"><b>Large Contemporary Pocket Door Lock</b></a></a>\r\n<p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana SDP60 Pocket Door Pull Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Height: 6\"</li>\r\n<li>Depth: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" </li>\r\n<li>Door Cutout: 2-1/4\" High by 1-3/4\" Deep </li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/SDP60.pdf?v=1691095375\" target=\"new\">Deltana SDP60 Dimensions  (PDF)</a></li>\r\n<!-- <li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/SDP25-install.pdf?v=1691095378\" target=\"new\">Deltana SDP25 Installation Instructions (PDF)</a></li> -->\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
